# Voxel photographer body: head with a dim cyan visor, placed on the head bone in actor space (x forward, y side,
# z up), like an outfit part. A hat from the Head slot sits on top.
name body_head
grid 5
size 5 4 5
slot skin SwatchMain
slot visor NeonCyan
box 0 0 0 5 4 5 skin
box 4 0 2 5 4 3 visor
pivot 2 2 0
